ind":"update","title":"🔥 The biggest Far Away Kingdom demo update yet is now available!","summary":"🎮 LOCAL CO-OP Far Away Kingdom can now be played solo or with a second player in local co-op. Fight through enemy hordes together, coordinate your attacks, and survive the chaos.🗺️ BRANCHING PATHS Runs no longer have to follow the same route. You can now choose between different paths during your journey, leading to different stages and encounters.🏆 GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS Your scores can now compete against players around the world through Steam leaderboards.⌨️🖱️ KEYBOARD + MOUSE SUPPORT The demo c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T17:54:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4699500-1836506165570491","game_id":"steam-4699500","kind":"update","title":"Far Away Kingdom – Demo Build 0.2.1 Patch Notes","summary":"Far Away Kingdom – Demo Build 0.2.1 Patch NotesAdded language selection support (English/Spanish).Fixed multiple issues related to particles and rendering layers.Fixed several sound effects and music-related bugs.Updated and improved the game's intro sequence.Enabled additional visual effects during the Chapter 1 final battle.Increased dash cooldown from 1.0s to 1.5s to improve balance for the new playable character.Added support for running the game in windowed mode.Ultra-wide resolutions are n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T13:14:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4699500-1834602721193719","game_id":"steam-4699500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.2.0 Now Availabl